      "side": 1,
      "message": "When I added the `cc_test` `tipc-test` as a dependency of the microdroid vendor image, it put that file under `/vendor/nativetest64/tipc-test/tipc-test` but without making it executable.\n\nAfaict the cause for this is the `fs_config` setup at https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/core/libcutils/fs_config.cpp;l\u003d87 or something related to that: everything under `/vendor/bin` is executable and owned by `root:shell` by default, other directories are `root:root`.\n\nOne better option would be for `android_filesystem` to allow us to specify additional `fs_config` entries for the vendor image, but that doesn\u0027t seem implemented yet.",
